optionDesc.cneModCompat:
Lets Codename Engine format mods load in Meteoric (off by default):
- charts songs/<song>/charts/<difficulty>.json (auto-converted to psych_v1);
- audio songs/<song>/song/Inst|Voices[-difficulty];
- characters data/characters/<name>.xml (auto-converted to Psych character JSON);
- weeks data/weeks/weeks/<week>.xml (appear in Story/Freeplay);
- .zip packs under mods/ (unpacked to mods/_cnestage/ on first use, and recognized in the Mod list).
⚠ Not covered: CNE stages data/stages/*.xml, character .hx extensions, data/notes/*.hx custom note behaviors.
